LicenseRef-Qt-ThirdParty is an index to component-specific upstream grants,
not a new license or a blanket license for Qt.

The source/ subtree preserves original notices, all LICENSES texts,
qt_attribution.json records and their referenced license bodies in their
original source-relative layout. source-notices.json pins the exact bytes.
The applicable grant remains the original per-file SPDX expression and
component notice. Qt libraries, tools, documentation and third-party code
have different terms; this candidate does not claim commercial Qt rights.

The project recipe/helper license is recorded separately in LICENSE.packaging.
